{{Codex|The Furis delivers a high damage output in a short time frame thanks to its high rate of fire.}}
The '''Furis''' is a machine pistol with a high rate of fire, causing an outcome of a high damage output, sacrificing ammo.

This weapon can be sold for {{cc|5,000}}; it is also a [[weapon crafting ingredient]] for {{Weapon|Afuris}} (x2).
{{Checklist|nocategory=true|
* {{Weapon|Furis}} + {{Weapon|Furis}} → {{Weapon|Afuris}}
}}

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Puncture}} damage.
*Innate {{Pol|Naramon}} polarity.
*Can use the Furis-exclusive {{M|Winds of Purity}} mod.

{{Advantages|
*Low recoil and very high accuracy, even at medium-far ranges.
}}

{{Disadvantages|
*Extremely inefficient [[Ammo#Ammo Efficiency|ammo economy]].
}}

{{WeaponComparison|Mk1-Furis}}
{{WeaponComparison|Afuris|header=n}}
==Acquisition==
The Furis's blueprint can be purchased from the [[Market]]. Alternatively, it can be acquired from completing the [[Earth]] to [[Venus]] [[Junction]].

{{BuildAutomatic|type=Weapon}}

