==Acquisition==
Fulmination was first acquired from Ergo Glast in a Tenno relay for 75 Animo Beacons during the [[Operation: Ambulas Reborn]] event.

It returned as an offering sold by [[Nakak]] (as [[Operational Supply]]) in [[Cetus]] during the [[Operation: Plague Star]] event for {{cc|5,000}} and {{sc|1,500}} Operational Supply Standing.

